<resources>
    <!-- German (de). Du, not Sie. Charge / Effort / Rest / HRV / WHOOP / NOOP stay untranslated.
         Correlation and experiment wording keeps its uncertainty: "tendenziell", "meist",
         "hängt zusammen mit", never "verursacht" and never "zeigt an". Strength and direction words
         come in two shapes: insights_strength_* / insights_direction_* are inflected masculine so
         they agree with "Zusammenhang", the noun those sentences build around; compare_strength_* /
         compare_direction_* stay uninflected because their sentences use them predicatively.
         Metric titles reach compare_insight_link lowercased by the caller, so its clauses are
         framed to keep that readable.
         -->

